"""Fixtures for the Go gateway's Airframe planner and contract tools (A-9 S5c), generated by driving the Python code:
airframe_plan.plan through AirframeTools.plan / changeset, AirframeTools.capabilities and AirframeTools.explain
(fake_airframe, the real tool logic over an in-memory cluster and the test fleet's registry), over a corpus of AppSpecs
(valid and every kind of refusal), base cicd.yaml variants and every contract kind, section, rule and condition reason.

gateway/internal/airframe/testdata/plan.json is read by gateway/internal/airframe/plan_python_test.go. A case may carry "go":
what Go answers where it deliberately differs from Python, with "why". The two files the Go package embeds are copies of
schemas/airframe-contract.json and schemas/appspec.schema.json (made by tools/gen_gateway_airframe.py).

Called by tools/gen_gateway_registry.py (outputs()), whose --check fails when a committed file differs.
"""
